+// cpp_extract.h: the recorder of bsv-script-lean's corpus/cpp family (#49).
+// Added by corpus/cpp/instrument.patch; not part of the reference. Included last
+// in an instrumented test file, it turns every EvalScript call there into a
+// recorded call: the inputs and the observed result go to one JSON line in the
+// file named by CPPX_OUT, and CPPX_EXPECT after the call's checks attaches what
+// those checks assert. With CPPX_OUT unset nothing is written and the tests run
+// as at the pin.
